Complete Step-by-Step Deployment Guide
Helpdesk AI System | React + Express + PostgreSQL | Vercel + Render

We'll deploy your Helpdesk AI system to the cloud so users can access it from their browsers, computers, and mobile devices without running your local development server.

This guide follows your existing deployment configuration and uses Windows PowerShell, GitHub, Render, and Vercel.
