Important: Paste the URL as plain text. Do not include Markdown brackets or parentheses around the URL.

Your script should generate or update:
helpdesk-ai/client/vercel.json


Step 8.3 — Inspect the Vercel configuration
Open:
notepad .\helpdesk-ai\client\vercel.json


Your application-specific configuration should provide two types of routing:
- Requests beginning with /api/ are forwarded to your Render API.
- React application pages such as /admin, /login, and /modules load through the Vite single-page application.
Do not blindly replace the generated configuration with a generic Vercel template. The API proxy needs to remain ahead of the SPA fallback so that /api/ready returns JSON rather than index.html.

Vercel supports these rules using vercel.json. 
